{"4935510":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Cellar Keeper","steam_appid":4935510,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【A Cozy Cellar Organization Simulator】<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A once-pristine cellar has fallen into complete disarray.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return <strong>2,448 bottles<\/strong> to their proper racks by identifying their <strong>varieties<\/strong> and restoring perfect order throughout the cellar.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4935510\/extras\/eef93e323bb0cb59fc880e87843483b3.poster.avif?t=1793207542\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4935510\/extras\/eef93e323bb0cb59fc880e87843483b3.webm?t=1793207542\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4935510\/extras\/eef93e323bb0cb59fc880e87843483b3.mp4?t=1793207542\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > 【The Forgotten Keeper】<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, the cellar belonged to an eccentric collector who loved his bottle collection more than anything else.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desperate to preserve it forever, he attempted an ancient spell. The cellar survived... but the spell turned him into a chicken and trapped him inside a small cage.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now the cellar has fallen into ruin.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore every rack, break the curse, and help the forgotten keeper see the sunlight once again.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4935510\/extras\/9bac48ca6f49247185904fbe8938d7cf.poster.avif?t=1793207542\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4935510\/extras\/9bac48ca6f49247185904fbe8938d7cf.webm?t=1793207542\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4935510\/extras\/9bac48ca6f49247185904fbe8938d7cf.mp4?t=1793207542\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Restore Order, One Rack at a Time】<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cellar starts in complete chaos.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you organize each rack, the room gradually transforms into a clean, beautiful collection.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watching disorder disappear is its own reward.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4935510\/extras\/b5e5f6e348aa60373893cd663b5a2c23.poster.avif?t=1793207542\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4935510\/extras\/b5e5f6e348aa60373893cd663b5a2c23.webm?t=1793207542\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4935510\/extras\/b5e5f6e348aa60373893cd663b5a2c23.mp4?t=1793207542\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Learn Skills to Organize Faster】<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful abilities that improve carrying, searching, and movement.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your upgrades wisely and discover the most efficient way to organize the cellar.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Two Ways to Play】<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Cozy<\/strong> <stro